Supra Concept Sliders is a product repository for adapters on
SupraLabs/Supra2-IMG. It is an independent HyperGAN project.

The base model is published by SupraLabs at
https://huggingface.co/SupraLabs/Supra2-IMG under the Apache License 2.0.
This repository does not vendor `model_final_ema.pt`, Flan-T5-Base, or
SD-VAE-FT-MSE. Rights to those weights stay with their publishers.

Source in this repository is MIT (LICENSE). The train and infer
implementation lives in HyperGAN/particle-sliders (`train_lora_supra.py`,
pull request 130) and is pinned by `backend.lock.json`.
